{"type":"message","id":"2d034aaa","parentId":"80505501","timestamp":"2026-05-20T02:31:55.473Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error 1101 which is a Cloudflare Workers exception. This means the Worker itself is throwing an exception. The issue might be with the request body format.\n\nLet me try to see if there's a different endpoint structure, maybe the send uses a different path like /api/send or /message, or maybe there's something wrong with the request format.\n\nActually, looking at the error 1101, this is a Cloudflare Workers error that indicates the worker code itself threw an exception. This could be because:\n1. The request body parsing is failing\n2. There's an internal error in the worker\n\nLet me try without the JSON body and see if there are any other endpoints that might work.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-4d454482-9802-4252-b48c-5faedf792b4b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try different body formats and endpoints\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"heartbeat test\"}' 2>&1\n\necho \"---\"\n\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":167,"output":331,"cacheRead":17968,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18466,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779244296306,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f47b1a71-5f7b-4ad4-adf0-1edf9cd2cb5d"}}
