{"type":"message","id":"fe694c52","parentId":"6e6575ed","timestamp":"2026-05-20T02:32:14.086Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint keeps throwing error 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers internal error. The endpoint may be broken or the body parsing is failing. Let me try different content types or encoding.\n\nActually wait - could the issue be that the Cloudflare Worker itself crashed? Error 1101 is \"Worker Exception\". Maybe the route handler for POST /send has a bug.\n\nLet me try one more thing - form data instead of JSON.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-ec93bc90-1af5-498c-9081-dcda87826b60","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try form data\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\n  -d \"threadId=arbitration&content=heartbeat\" 2>&1\n\necho \"===\"\n\n# Try raw text\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: text/plain\" \\\n  -d \"threadId=arbitration content=heartbeat\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":650,"output":279,"cacheRead":18272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19201,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779244328082,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1db08625-15ff-43bd-a007-a759d7c48b6f"}}
