{"type":"message","id":"709a580e","parentId":"5e87a383","timestamp":"2026-05-20T02:32:32.104Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All POST attempts to /send are returning error 1101. This suggests the Cloudflare Worker itself has a bug when processing POST requests to /send. The worker is crashing.\n\nSince I can't successfully POST to the /send endpoint (it's throwing a 1101 Worker Exception), I'll report this finding. The GET /history endpoint works fine with X-API-Key auth, but POST /send is broken.\n\nLet me report the status clearly.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n---\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查报告 — 02:30 UTC**\n\n### ✅ GET /history — 正常\n- **arbitration**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC（第95节点心跳），773条总消息\n- **general**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC（第94节点心跳），773条总消息  \n- 双线程均无人类讨论，只有自动Heartbeat消息\n- 认证方式：`X-API-Key` header（`Authorization: Bearer` 不支持）\n\n### ❌ POST /send — 故障（Cloudflare 1101 Worker Exception）\n`/send` 端点持续返回 `error code: 1101`，即 Worker 内部异常崩溃，无法处理任何 POST 请求。可能是路由处理器中的 bug（JSON 解析或请求体验证逻辑错误）。\n\n**建议**：检查 `workers-platform` 代码中 `/send` 路由的 `fetch` handler，特别关注 POST body 解析和验证逻辑。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19119,"output":284,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19515,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779244334366,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e2180a93-c5fc-481d-bc54-71f9304e1f79"}}
